                                                "sense_id": "dbf66a19-4f06-3618-9ec2-8f1473f50df7",
                                                "text": "In the time available to us on our geomorphological tour we were not able to see the higher and younger karsts of Kweichow and Yunnan and Kunming."
                                            },
